## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Loot
## Notes: Dungeon and raid loot, quests (with the quests before each one and map pins on the quest givers), item sets and profession recipes for WoW: Forever, with class filters, a search across all of them, a wishlist, and where-it-drops lines on every item tooltip. Built from Wowhead, wowtbc.gg, Mobalytics and cMaNGOS.
